 "check": {
  "describe": "The host level (76, not charging) gives a green icon about three quarters full and \"76%\"; the first flow shows 95 (green, nearly full), 40 (amber) and 18 (red, with a red ! in the empty part); the second flow shows 54 and 5 charging: both green with a dark (light theme) or light (dark theme) bolt with a thin halo over the body, and no ! on the 5. The large icon follows the host level. With battery = 15 (the low render) the first and last icons turn red and show the !; with charging = 1 (the charging render) they keep the green fill and gain the bolt. In mono the bolt is a black silhouette on the white fill and a white outline over the black empty part (the reverse in mono-light). The icons keep their size and sit in flows: at 240 dp the 18% one wraps to a second line, at 420 dp everything stays at the start.",
